#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:45
msgid "Configuration-only customization"
msgstr "只改配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:47
msgid ""
"Start with the annotated `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` and "
"`config/examples/branding.example.yaml`. Keep deployment-owned files in "
"your distribution repository or overlay, with credentials in the "
"environment. Use the standard frontend image with no Site UI selection to"
" keep the default page layouts. Reusing that image assumes its compiled "
"backend network target matches your deployment; see [When changes take "
"effect](#when-changes-take-effect)."
msgstr ""
"先从带注释的 `config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` 和 "
"`config/examples/branding.example.yaml` 入手。属于部署的文件放在发行版仓库或 overlay "
"里，凭据放在环境变量里。想保留默认的页面布局，就用标准前端镜像，不选任何 Site UI "
"模块。复用这个镜像有个前提：镜像编译时确定的后端网络地址要和你的部署一致；见[变更何时生效](#when-changes-take-"
"effect)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:54
msgid "Where your files live"
msgstr "文件放在哪里"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:56
msgid ""
"A real deployment's configuration lives in a **distribution overlay**: "
"one directory under `distributions/` holding that deployment's manifest, "
"config files, Compose/env inputs, and branding."
msgstr ""
"真实部署的配置放在 **发行版 overlay** 里：`distributions/` 下的一个目录，装着该部署的 "
"manifest、配置文件、Compose/env 输入和品牌信息。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:71
msgid ""
"The split exists so the source tree and the container image stay neutral."
" Model IDs, upstream base URLs, ports, site identity and branding are "
"properties of one deployment, not of the project; keeping them in an "
"overlay means the image can be built once and a deployment's overlay "
"mounted into it (`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` mounts the overlay "
"read-only rather than baking it into the image). It also means a clone of"
" this repository ships nobody's hosts."
msgstr ""
"这样拆分，是为了让源码树和容器镜像保持中立。模型 id、上游 base "
"URL、端口、站点信息和品牌，都属于某一个部署，而不属于项目本身；把它们放进 overlay，镜像就可以只构建一次，再把某个部署的 overlay"
" 挂载进去（`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` 以只读方式挂载 "
"overlay，而不是把它打包进镜像）。这也意味着，从本仓库克隆下来的代码不会带上任何人的主机地址。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:78
msgid ""
"For config-path precedence and admin overrides, see "
"[Configuration](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config)."
msgstr "配置路径的优先级和管理覆盖设置见[配置](configuration.md#how-a-gateway-finds-its-config)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:81
msgid "The distribution manifest"
msgstr "发行版 manifest"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:83
msgid ""
"A manifest is one versioned YAML document that names a deployment and "
"tells the gateway where its config files are. "
"`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` is the annotated reference. "
"Both examples below and in that file close public signup when activated; "
"change `public_signup` to `true` or null if this deployment should accept"
" new accounts through the public signup API:"
msgstr ""
"manifest 是一份带版本号的 YAML "
"文档，它给部署命名，并告诉网关这个部署的配置文件在哪里。`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` "
"是带注释的参考示例。下面的示例和该文件里的示例一旦启用，都会关闭公开注册；如果这个部署需要通过公开注册 API 接受新账号，请把 "
"`public_signup` 改成 `true` 或 null："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:115
msgid ""
"`schema_version` must be `1`. `distribution.id` identifies the "
"distribution; `display_name` is its public name, and `release` records "
"its version. `deployment.target` records an operator label such as "
"`local` or `staging`; it does not select a host, build an image or deploy"
" a service."
msgstr ""
"`schema_version` 必须为 `1`。`distribution.id` 标识发行版，`display_name` "
"是公开名称，`release` 记录版本。`deployment.target` 记录 `local` 或 `staging` "
"等运维标签；它不会选择主机、构建镜像或部署服务。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:120
msgid ""
"`paths.models`, `paths.routing` and `paths.alerts` select gateway "
"configuration files. Relative paths are resolved from the manifest "
"directory; explicit gateway environment overrides still take precedence. "
"`paths.mcp` and the legal-document fields are accepted but have the "
"limitations described below."
msgstr ""
"`paths.models`、`paths.routing` 和 `paths.alerts` 指定网关使用的配置文件。相对路径以 "
"manifest 所在目录为基准；如果显式设置了网关的环境变量，仍以环境变量为准。`paths.mcp` "
"和法律文档相关字段可以写，但有下文说明的限制。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:125
msgid "Point the gateway at it with two environment variables:"
msgstr "用两个环境变量把网关指向它："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:132
msgid ""
"**Public sign-up.** With an active manifest, `features.public_signup: "
"false` closes sign-up completely: the sign-up page disappears and `POST "
"/auth/signup` answers 403 without creating an account. Neither "
"`SIGNUP_ENABLED=true` nor the sign-up switch in the admin console can "
"reopen it, and the admin API refuses that change with 400. To allow sign-"
"up, set the field to `true` or remove it, restart the backend, and make "
"sure the sign-up switch is on."
msgstr ""
"**公开注册**。manifest 已启用时，`features.public_signup: false` "
"会彻底关闭注册：注册页面消失，`POST /auth/signup` 返回 403，不会创建账号。无论是 "
"`SIGNUP_ENABLED=true` 还是管理控制台里的注册开关，都无法重新打开注册，管理 API 也会以 400 "
"拒绝这项修改。要开放注册，把该字段设为 `true` 或删掉它，重启后端，并确认注册开关是打开的。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:139
msgid ""
"When the manifest allows sign-up, or no manifest is active, the admin "
"console's switch wins over `SIGNUP_ENABLED` (default `true`). `GET /site-"
"config` reports the result in `features.public_signup`, and the console "
"follows it. Email verification, domain-based approval and quotas still "
"apply to every new account."
msgstr ""
"当 manifest 允许注册，或者没有启用 manifest 时，管理控制台里的开关优先于 `SIGNUP_ENABLED`（默认 "
"`true`）。`GET /site-config` 通过 `features.public_signup` "
"返回最终结果，控制台以它为准。邮箱验证、按域名审批和配额，对每个新账号依然照常生效。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:145
msgid ""
"If the gateway cannot read the sign-up switch from its database within "
"one second, it treats sign-up as closed rather than falling back to "
"`SIGNUP_ENABLED`, and tries again after five seconds. Saving the switch "
"in the admin console clears the error at once."
msgstr ""
"如果网关在一秒内没能从数据库读到注册开关，它会把注册当作关闭处理，而不是改用 "
"`SIGNUP_ENABLED`，并在五秒后再试。在管理控制台里保存一次这个开关，错误会立即消除。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:150
msgid ""
"**Public usage stats.** `features.public_stats: true` publishes aggregate"
" traffic figures at `/stats`: tokens served per day, countries, the "
"languages people write in and the agent clients that call the API. The "
"page reads `GET /public-stats`, which serves the newest snapshot from the"
" `public_stats_snapshots` table and answers 404 when the flag is off or "
"unset. Snapshots are written by a job you schedule once a day, for "
"example from cron or a systemd timer:"
msgstr ""
"**公开用量统计**。`features.public_stats: true` 会在 `/stats` 发布汇总的流量数据："
"每日处理的 token 数、国家和地区、用户书写所用的语言，以及调用 API 的智能体客户端。"
"该页面读取 `GET /public-stats`，它返回 `public_stats_snapshots` 表中最新的快照；"
"开关关闭或未设置时返回 404。快照由你每天调度一次的任务写入，例如通过 cron 或 "
"systemd timer："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:162
msgid ""
"Add `--dry-run` to print the snapshot instead of storing it, and `--weeks"
" N` to change the 26-week window. The job reads `api_logs` and the hourly"
" country rollup and stores aggregates only. Per-item account counts below"
" 3 are withheld. The language section needs message text, so it is left "
"out unless `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT=true`. A snapshot over 10 weeks of a "
"busy gateway takes about a minute. The job keeps the 30 newest snapshots."
msgstr ""
"加上 `--dry-run` 只打印快照而不写入，`--weeks N` 可修改默认 26 周的时间窗口。"
"该任务读取 `api_logs` 和每小时的国家汇总表，只存储汇总数据。低于 3 个账户的单项计数"
"不会公开。语言部分需要消息原文，因此只有在 `DB_STORE_FULL_CONTENT=true` 时才会生成。"
"在繁忙的网关上统计 10 周数据约需一分钟。任务只保留最新的 30 个快照。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:169
msgid "Activating a manifest"
msgstr "启用 manifest"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:171
msgid ""
"Setting `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` alone changes nothing. By default the "
"gateway only does a dry run: it loads and checks the manifest and logs "
"what it would change, but keeps using the configuration it had. The "
"setting for this is `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE`, and its default value, "
"`dark`, means dry run:"
msgstr ""
"只设置 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 不会改变任何东西。网关默认只做试运行：加载并校验 "
"manifest，在日志里记下它会改动什么，但继续沿用原来的配置。控制这一点的设置是 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE`，它的默认值 `dark` 就表示试运行："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:182
msgid ""
"Read those lines, then set `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` to apply the"
" manifest. If an active manifest fails to load — a missing mount, a YAML "
"error — the gateway logs it at `CRITICAL` and comes up with no models, "
"rather than serving a different registry from the one you named. In a dry"
" run the same failure is only logged."
msgstr ""
"先看这几行日志，再设置 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 让 manifest 生效。已启用的 manifest"
" 如果加载失败（比如挂载缺失、YAML 写错），网关会记一条 `CRITICAL` "
"日志，然后在没有任何模型的状态下运行，而不会拿一份不是你指定的模型注册表来提供服务。试运行时，同样的失败只会记进日志。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:188
msgid ""
"Leave the mode unset or set it to exactly `dark` or `active`. Any other "
"value, an empty one, or `active` without a manifest path is treated as a "
"broken configuration: sign-up closes (403), `/site-config` answers 503, "
"and the [docs assistant](rag-chat.md) endpoints answer 503. The warning "
"appears once, in the startup log, so when you see those errors check "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` and `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`, fix them and "
"restart the backend."
msgstr ""
"模式要么不设，要么严格设为 `dark` 或 `active`。任何其他值、空值，或者设了 `active` 却没有给出 manifest "
"路径，都会被当作配置损坏：注册关闭（403），`/site-config` 返回 503，[文档助手](rag-chat.md)的端点也返回 "
"503。这条警告只会在启动日志里出现一次，所以看到这些错误时，请检查 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 和 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`，改正后重启后端。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:195
msgid ""
"**Check a manifest before you activate or upgrade it.** Unknown keys at "
"the top level and under `features` are rejected, so a misspelled feature "
"(`publicSignup`, `public-signup`) or a feature placed at the top level "
"fails loudly. Keep operator-specific notes in a separate file. With "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` set to the manifest you will deploy, run this "
"with the version you are about to deploy:"
msgstr ""
"**启用或升级 manifest 之前，先检查它**。顶层和 `features` "
"下的未知键会被拒绝，所以拼错的功能名（`publicSignup`、`public-"
"signup`）或错放到顶层的功能会直接报错。运维人员自己的备注请另放一个文件。把 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` "
"设为你要部署的 manifest，然后用即将部署的那个版本运行："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:213
msgid ""
"The `paths`, `site`, `distribution` and `deployment` sections still "
"ignore keys they do not know, so a misspelled path key silently falls "
"back to the default registry. After activating, check that the startup "
"log's `Registered N routes from <path>` names the file you meant."
msgstr ""
"`paths`、`site`、`distribution` 和 `deployment` "
"这几节仍会忽略不认识的键，所以拼错的路径键会悄悄回退到默认的模型注册表。启用之后，请确认启动日志里 `Registered N routes "
"from <path>` 这一行指向的是你想要的文件。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:218
msgid "Identity, and what the manifest must not contain"
msgstr "站点信息，以及 manifest 里不能放什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:220
msgid ""
"The manifest's `site:` and `features:` sections are public: `GET /site-"
"config` serves them to every visitor once the manifest is active. The "
"site's name and address also appear in the emails the gateway sends and "
"in the headers it sends to OpenRouter; those come from `SITE_NAME`, "
"`SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`, `SITE_DOCS_URL` and `SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL` when "
"they are set, then from an active manifest, then from neutral defaults. "
"The standard Compose file sets `SITE_NAME` to `HybridInference` unless "
"you set it, so set it to your site's name — or to an empty value to use "
"the manifest's."
msgstr ""
"manifest 的 `site:` 和 `features:` 两节是公开的：manifest 启用后，`GET /site-config` "
"会把它们返回给每一位访客。站点名称和地址还会出现在网关发出的邮件里，以及它发给 OpenRouter 的请求头里；取值顺序是：先用已设置的 "
"`SITE_NAME`、`SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`、`SITE_DOCS_URL` 和 "
"`SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL`，其次是已启用的 manifest，最后是中立的默认值。你不设置时，标准 Compose 文件会把 "
"`SITE_NAME` 设为 `HybridInference`，所以请把它设成你的站点名称，或者设为空值，改用 manifest 里的名称。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:229
msgid ""
"Manifests must not contain secrets. Credentials stay in the environment, "
"and `schema_version: 1` deliberately does not interpolate environment "
"variables into manifest values."
msgstr ""
"manifest 里绝不能放密钥。凭据留在环境变量里，而且 `schema_version: 1` 特意不支持在 manifest "
"的值里插入环境变量。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:233
msgid "Runtime branding"
msgstr "运行时品牌配置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:235
msgid ""
"Copy the complete `config/examples/branding.example.yaml`, set its public"
" values, and point `site.branding` at it. The path is relative to the "
"manifest's directory. Set the site's name in `distribution.display_name`;"
" a display name alone, without a branding document, does not replace the "
"frontend's default name. The branding document is validated at backend "
"startup and exposed through `/site-config`, so every value in it must be "
"safe for a visitor to read."
msgstr ""
"把完整的 `config/examples/branding.example.yaml` 复制一份，填好其中的公开值，再让 "
"`site.branding` 指向它。这个路径相对于 manifest 所在的目录。站点名称在 "
"`distribution.display_name` "
"里设置；但如果没有品牌文档，只设显示名称并不会替换前端的默认名称。品牌文档在后端启动时校验，并通过 `/site-config` "
"公开，所以里面的每个值都必须是可以给访客看的。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Branding field"
msgstr "品牌字段"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "What the default UI uses it for"
msgstr "默认 UI 用它做什么"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`schema_version`"
msgstr "`schema_version`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Branding document version; currently `1`"
msgstr "品牌文档版本；当前为 `1`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`app_description`, `site_host`"
msgstr "`app_description`, `site_host`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Site description and displayed host"
msgstr "站点描述和展示的主机名"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`organization.name`, `.url`, `.tagline`"
msgstr "`organization.name`, `.url`, `.tagline`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Organization identity, link and tagline"
msgstr "组织信息、链接和标语"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`links.docs_url`, `.status_url`, `.github_url`"
msgstr "`links.docs_url`, `.status_url`, `.github_url`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Named documentation, status and repository links; an empty string hides "
"an optional link"
msgstr "文档、状态页和仓库链接；空字符串会隐藏可选链接"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`links.nav`"
msgstr "`links.nav`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Extra HTTPS header links, each with `label` and `url`, in the listed "
"order; does not replace existing navigation"
msgstr "额外的 HTTPS 页头链接，每项包含 `label` 和 `url`，按列表顺序展示；不会替换现有导航"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`example.api_base`, `.api_key_env_var`, `.model`"
msgstr "`example.api_base`, `.api_key_env_var`, `.model`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Public quickstart example; an empty API base hides it. The environment-"
"variable name is an example, not an API-key value"
msgstr "公开的快速开始示例；API base 为空时不显示。这里填的是环境变量名，只是示例，不是 API key 的值"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`analytics.statcounter_project_id`, `.statcounter_security_key`"
msgstr "`analytics.statcounter_project_id`, `.statcounter_security_key`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Public identifiers for optional client-side analytics; empty values "
"disable it"
msgstr "可选的客户端统计分析所用的公开标识；留空即不启用"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`signup.turnstile_site_key`, `.fast_track_domain`, `.fast_track_org`"
msgstr "`signup.turnstile_site_key`, `.fast_track_domain`, `.fast_track_org`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Public widget key and affiliated-organization signup presentation; not "
"server secrets or authorization rules"
msgstr "公开的 widget key，以及关联组织在注册页上的展示方式；不是服务端密钥，也不是授权规则"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`storage_key_prefix`"
msgstr "`storage_key_prefix`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Namespace for browser storage; changing it does not migrate existing "
"stored preferences"
msgstr "浏览器存储的命名空间；修改后不会迁移已存储的偏好设置"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`data_policy_notice`"
msgstr "`data_policy_notice`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Displayed data-policy notice; does not configure backend data handling"
msgstr "页面上显示的数据政策提示；不影响后端如何处理数据"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`assets.logo_url`, `.favicon_url`"
msgstr "`assets.logo_url`, `.favicon_url`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "Branding images, served from permitted HTTPS URLs or `/site-assets/*`"
msgstr "品牌图片，通过允许的 HTTPS URL 或 `/site-assets/*` 提供"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`team`"
msgstr "`team`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"`/team` profiles: `name`, `affiliations`, and optional `badge`, `image`, "
"`website`"
msgstr "`/team` 的人物资料：`name`、`affiliations`，以及可选的 `badge`、`image`、`website`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid "`sponsors`"
msgstr "`sponsors`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md
msgid ""
"Default-home sponsor images: `name`, `alt`, `src`, `class_name`, `width`,"
" `height`"
msgstr "默认首页的赞助商图片：`name`、`alt`、`src`、`class_name`、`width`、`height`"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:258
msgid ""
"Use the template and the schema in `serving/config/branding.py` for "
"permitted values. Branding rejects unknown keys; required fields cannot "
"simply be omitted. For optional content, use the documented empty "
"strings/lists. Sponsor `class_name` accepts the schema's supported image-"
"size classes, not arbitrary CSS. No branding field supplies a universal "
"palette, font or page layout. Custom page components decide which runtime"
" branding values they render."
msgstr ""
"允许哪些值，以模板和 `serving/config/branding.py` 里的 schema "
"为准。品牌配置会拒绝未知键；必填字段不能直接省略。可选内容不需要时，按文档写空字符串或空列表。赞助商的 `class_name` 只接受 "
"schema 支持的图片尺寸类名，不能写任意 CSS。没有哪个品牌字段能设置全局配色、字体或页面布局。自定义页面组件自己决定渲染哪些运行时品牌值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:265
msgid ""
"Serve local branding images through the mounted site-assets directory and"
" `/site-assets/*`, or use permitted public asset URLs. Check the URLs "
"over HTTP. A failed or invalid `/site-config` response produces a "
"configuration error instead of silently rendering a working site with "
"different defaults."
msgstr ""
"本地的品牌图片放在挂载的 site-assets 目录里，通过 `/site-assets/*` 访问；也可以用允许的公开资源 URL。用 "
"HTTP 实际请求一下这些 URL 来确认。如果 `/site-config` "
"请求失败或返回无效内容，页面会报配置错误，而不会悄悄换一套默认值，显示一个看似正常的站点。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:270
msgid "Feature settings and their limits"
msgstr "功能设置及其限制"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:272
msgid ""
"`features.rag: false` in an active manifest disables the RAG UI and "
"backend access. Allowing RAG still requires the service's configuration; "
"see [Docs RAG Assistant](rag-chat.md)."
msgstr ""
"在已启用的 manifest 里设置 `features.rag: false`，会同时关掉 RAG 的界面和后端访问。开启 RAG "
"仍然需要把服务本身配置好；见[文档 RAG 助手](rag-chat.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:275
msgid ""
"`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL`, or the internal agent service destinations, configure"
" the existing agent link/proxy integration. They do not install an agent "
"service. See [The public path table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_PUBLIC_URL`，或者内部 agent 服务的目标地址，用来配置现有的 agent 链接／代理集成；它们不会替你安装 "
"agent 服务。见[公开路径表](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:278
msgid ""
"`features.routers`, `paths.mcp`, `site.terms_document`, "
"`site.privacy_document` and `deployment.target` are accepted but have no "
"effect yet; see [Settings that currently have no effect](configuration.md"
"#settings-that-currently-have-no-effect). To publish your own terms, use "
"a [Site UI module](site-ui-modules.md)."
msgstr ""
"`features.routers`、`paths.mcp`、`site.terms_document`、`site.privacy_document`"
" 和 `deployment.target` 可以写，但目前还不起作用；见[目前不生效的设置](configuration.md"
"#settings-that-currently-have-no-effect)。要发布自己的条款，请使用 [Site UI 模块](site-"
"ui-modules.md)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:284
msgid ""
"A public branding hint or hidden navigation item is not a substitute for "
"backend authorization. The registration rules above remain effective with"
" a custom UI module."
msgstr "在公开的品牌配置里加个提示、或者把导航项藏起来，都代替不了后端授权。用了自定义 UI 模块，上面的注册规则照样生效。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:288
msgid ""
"Model/provider changes made through supported admin APIs take effect on "
"the running gateway and are persisted in its database. They do not "
"rewrite the YAML; stored overrides are applied on top of it again at "
"startup. Account for both layers when investigating a configuration "
"difference. See [Runtime configuration](configuration.md#runtime-"
"configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"通过受支持的管理 API 修改模型或 provider，会在运行中的网关上生效，并保存到它的数据库里。这些修改不会改写 "
"YAML；每次启动时，保存下来的覆盖设置会重新叠加到 YAML "
"之上。排查配置不一致时，这两层都要看。见[运行时配置](configuration.md#runtime-configuration-from-"
"the-admin-console)。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:294
msgid "When changes take effect"
msgstr "变更何时生效"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:296
msgid ""
"Restart the backend after changing mounted manifest, branding, "
"model/routing or alert files. Reload the page to check presentation; the "
"backend serves the branding snapshot loaded at startup."
msgstr "改了挂载的 manifest、品牌、模型／路由或告警文件，要重启后端。刷新页面看展示效果；后端提供的是启动时加载的那份品牌配置快照。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:299
msgid ""
"Replace mounted site-assets files without rebuilding an image. The route "
"allows five minutes of browser caching, so verify the served URL and "
"account for browser/proxy caches. Changing `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` itself "
"requires recreating the frontend container."
msgstr ""
"替换挂载的 site-assets 文件不需要重新构建镜像。这个路由允许浏览器缓存五分钟，所以要直接请求实际的 URL "
"来确认，并把浏览器和代理的缓存考虑进去。改 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 本身则需要重新创建前端容器。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:303
msgid ""
"Recreate the affected container after changing runtime environment "
"values. A plain container restart retains its old environment. Server-"
"only agent destinations are runtime values."
msgstr "改了运行时环境变量，要重新创建受影响的容器；只重启容器的话，用的还是原来的环境变量。只在服务端使用的 agent 目标地址也属于运行时值。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:306
msgid ""
"Use the admin console/API for supported live edits, and check effective "
"values and any feature-specific caching."
msgstr "支持在线修改的设置，通过管理控制台或 API 来改，然后确认实际生效的值，以及这个功能有没有自己的缓存。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:308
msgid ""
"Rebuild the frontend after changing true build-only `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` "
"values or the backend network target compiled from "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`. These differ from runtime branding and are not "
"changed by a backend restart."
msgstr ""
"如果改的是真正只在构建时生效的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 值，或者由 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` "
"编译进去的后端网络地址，就要重新构建前端。这些值和运行时品牌配置不同，重启后端不会改变它们。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:312
msgid ""
"Use runtime branding for identity rather than introducing new build-time "
"branding variables. The precise Compose commands are in "
"[Deployment](deployment.md#what-a-change-actually-requires). Rebuild the "
"affected image when configuration or assets are baked into it instead of "
"mounted."
msgstr ""
"站点信息请用运行时品牌配置来设置，不要再引入新的构建时品牌变量。具体的 Compose 命令见[部署](deployment.md#what-a"
"-change-actually-requires)。配置或资源如果是打包进镜像、而不是挂载进去的，改了之后要重新构建对应的镜像。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:317
msgid "The example distribution"
msgstr "示例发行版"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:319
msgid ""
"`distributions/example/` is a complete, runnable distribution kept in the"
" repository as an example: a manifest, a one-model registry pointing at a"
" bundled fake provider that needs no credential, Compose overlays, and "
"smoke scripts. Walk through it with the [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md):"
msgstr ""
"`distributions/example/` 是一个完整、可运行的发行版，作为示例留在仓库里：一份 "
"manifest、一份只含单个模型的注册表（指向仓库自带、无需凭据的假 provider）、Compose "
"overlay，以及冒烟脚本。可以跟着[快速开始](router-tutorial.md)走一遍："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:330
msgid ""
"It carries a marker file, `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`, whose presence keeps it out "
"of automatic discovery. The Makefile picks a distribution like this:"
msgstr "它带着一个标记文件 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`，只要这个文件在，它就不会被自动发现选中。Makefile 挑选发行版的规则是这样的："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:333
msgid ""
"Overlays are discovered from `distributions/*/deploy/*.env`, minus any "
"directory containing `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`."
msgstr ""
"根据 `distributions/*/deploy/*.env` 发现 overlay，但排除所有含有 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` "
"的目录。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:335
msgid ""
"Exactly one candidate: it is selected automatically, and `make` prints "
"which identity it is compiling in."
msgstr "恰好一个候选：自动选中它，`make` 会打印出它要编译进去的是哪个站点的信息。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:337
msgid "Several candidates: `make` fails and asks you to name one."
msgstr "有多个候选：`make` 失败，并要求你指定其中一个。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:338
msgid ""
"None (the state of a fresh clone of this repository): no overlay is "
"selected, and the stack is neutral."
msgstr "一个都没有（刚克隆本仓库时就是这个状态）：不选任何 overlay，整套服务保持中立。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:341
msgid ""
"`DISTRIBUTION=<name>` selects one by name — including the example, which "
"is only ever selected explicitly. `DISTRIBUTION=none` opts out."
msgstr ""
"`DISTRIBUTION=<name>` 按名字选择一个，示例发行版也可以这样选，而且只能这样选。`DISTRIBUTION=none` "
"表示不选任何发行版。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:344
msgid "Custom public pages and backend code"
msgstr "自定义公开页面和后端代码"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:346
msgid ""
"Configuration covers the site's identity, its branding, its models and "
"its feature switches. Two further interfaces go beyond that, each with a "
"build or deployment cost of its own:"
msgstr "配置能覆盖的是站点信息、品牌、模型和功能开关。超出这个范围，还有两个接口可用，各自有额外的构建或部署成本："

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:350
msgid ""
"[Site UI Modules](site-ui-modules.md) replace the public pages — the home"
" page, the frame around the account pages, the terms — with the "
"distribution's own React components, compiled into its console image."
msgstr ""
"[Site UI 模块](site-ui-modules.md)用发行版自己的 React "
"组件替换公开页面（首页、账号页面的外壳、条款页），这些组件会编译进发行版的控制台镜像。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:353
msgid ""
"[Backend Extensions](backend-extensions.md) load trusted Python code at "
"startup to add an adapter, a Cloud Agent access rule or a quota source."
msgstr ""
"[后端扩展](backend-extensions.md)在启动时加载可信的 Python 代码，用来添加 adapter、云端 Agent "
"访问规则或配额来源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:356
msgid "Upgrade checklist"
msgstr "升级检查清单"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:358
msgid ""
"This repository maintains the application and the interfaces it "
"publishes: configuration, Site UI modules and backend extensions. Each "
"distribution maintains its own configuration, module, deployment and any "
"fork, and decides when to upgrade."
msgstr ""
"本仓库维护应用本身，以及它对外发布的接口：配置、Site UI 模块和后端扩展。每个发行版自己维护自己的配置、模块、部署以及可能有的 "
"fork，并自己决定什么时候升级。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:363
msgid "An existing source fork"
msgstr "已有的源码 fork"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:365
msgid ""
"Inventory local changes by route and behavior. Separate branding values, "
"public-page presentation, shared-console changes and backend logic."
msgstr "按路由和行为盘点本地修改，区分品牌值、公开页面展示、共享控制台修改和后端逻辑。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:367
msgid ""
"Where they fit, move values into runtime configuration and public-page "
"presentation into a Site UI module. Migration is optional; you can keep "
"the fork, with its ongoing merge and verification work. A UI module keeps"
" authentication controllers shared."
msgstr ""
"能迁的就迁：配置值迁到运行时配置，公开页面的展示迁到 Site UI 模块。迁移不是必须的；也可以继续保留 "
"fork，但要一直承担合并和验证的工作。用 UI 模块时，认证控制器仍然是共用的。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:371
msgid ""
"Identify remaining source changes explicitly. Console redesigns, extra "
"routes and new authentication behavior do not become supported module "
"features merely by moving files into the module directory."
msgstr "把剩下的源码改动明确列出来。重新设计控制台、增加路由、新的认证行为，不会因为文件挪进了模块目录，就变成受支持的模块功能。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:374
msgid ""
"Merge the intended upstream version in an isolated branch, resolve "
"conflicts against your required behavior, and build the exact "
"frontend/backend pair."
msgstr "在单独的分支里合并要升级到的上游版本，按你需要的行为解决冲突，然后构建出要发布的那一对前端／后端。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:376
msgid ""
"Verify the distribution in staging before promoting it. A successful "
"merge or upstream CI result alone does not verify a fork's presentation "
"or flows."
msgstr "上线前，先在 staging 环境验证发行版。合并成功、上游 CI 通过，都不能说明 fork 的页面展示和流程没问题。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:379
msgid ""
"Adopting Site UI can reduce future conflicts; it does not automatically "
"migrate an existing fork or make arbitrary upstream source paths stable "
"interfaces."
msgstr "改用 Site UI 可以减少以后的冲突，但它不会自动迁移已有的 fork，也不会让上游任意一条源码路径变成稳定接口。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:382
msgid "Before promotion"
msgstr "上线前"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:384
msgid ""
"Pin the upstream version and, for custom UI, the module version and "
"produced image digest. Keep the matching configuration and asset versions"
" recoverable."
msgstr "锁定上游版本；用了自定义 UI 的，还要锁定模块版本和构建出的镜像摘要（digest）。确保与之匹配的配置和资源版本都能找回来。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:386
msgid ""
"Read configuration/API migration notes and validate against the selected "
"version. Unsupported module API revisions must stop the build."
msgstr "阅读配置和 API 的迁移说明，并针对选定的版本做校验。遇到不受支持的模块 API 版本，构建必须中止。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:388
msgid ""
"Inspect the actual image's `/app/site-ui-manifest.json` to confirm the "
"intended standard or custom build; test packaged and mounted assets over "
"HTTP."
msgstr ""
"检查实际镜像中的 `/app/site-ui-manifest.json`，确认构建结果使用的是预期的标准 UI 或自定义 UI；通过 HTTP "
"测试打包资源和挂载资源。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:390
msgid ""
"Check public routes, configured links, narrow/wide layouts, keyboard "
"access, form validation/loading/errors, login/logout and the registration"
" policy."
msgstr "检查公开路由、配置的链接、窄屏／宽屏布局、键盘操作、表单校验／加载／错误状态、登录／退出和注册策略。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:392
msgid ""
"Check the authenticated console, user/admin permissions and an inference "
"request against the deployed candidate, including any local fork "
"behavior."
msgstr "在部署好的候选版本上，检查登录后的控制台、用户和管理员权限，并发一次推理请求；fork 里的本地行为也要覆盖到。"

#: ../developer/distribution-customization.md:394
msgid ""
"Promote only the tested image/configuration combination and retain the "
"prior combination for rollback."
msgstr "只上线测试过的那组镜像和配置，并保留上一组，以便回滚。"

#~ msgid "1. What you can customize"
#~ msgstr "1\\. 能改什么"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "“Runtime configuration” below means "
#~ "configuration read by the running "
#~ "services; it does not mean every "
#~ "file is watched or that an open"
#~ " browser updates live. The filenames "
#~ "below follow the example layout; "
#~ "manifest paths can name other files "
#~ "in your distribution."
#~ msgstr "下文中的“运行时配置”是指由运行中的服务读取的配置，并不表示每个文件都有变更监听，也不表示已打开的浏览器页面会实时更新。以下文件名采用示例目录结构；清单中的路径可以指向发行版内的其他文件。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "There is no configuration field for "
#~ "an arbitrary home-page hero and no"
#~ " public interface for replacing the "
#~ "console's overall theme, sidebar or "
#~ "layout. Adding a navigation link does"
#~ " not register a route. A localized"
#~ " home page does not imply a "
#~ "fully localized console; module wording, "
#~ "page titles and document language are"
#~ " covered under [Your public pages"
#~ "](#your-public-pages)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "目前没有用于任意首页主视觉区域的配置字段，也没有替换控制台整体主题、侧边栏或布局的公开接口。添加导航链接不会注册路由。首页本地化并不意味着整个控制台都已本地化；模块文案、页面标题与文档语言的说明见[自有公开页面"
#~ "](#your-public-pages)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The admin API rejects attempts to "
#~ "set `signup_enabled=true` while the active "
#~ "manifest disables signup (HTTP 400, "
#~ "without saving the setting). Manifest "
#~ "root and `features` fields reject "
#~ "unknown keys, including `public-signup`, "
#~ "`publicSignup`, or a `public_signup` field "
#~ "at the manifest root."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "active manifest 关闭注册时，管理员 API 会拒绝设置 "
#~ "`signup_enabled=true`（返回 HTTP 400，不保存设置）。manifest "
#~ "根节点和 `features` 会拒绝未知字段，包括 `public-"
#~ "signup`、`publicSignup`，以及写在 manifest 根节点的 "
#~ "`public_signup`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If a runtime signup-setting read "
#~ "fails or exceeds one second, the "
#~ "gateway temporarily disables public signup."
#~ " A valid `/site-config` response "
#~ "still returns HTTP 200 with its "
#~ "identity and branding intact and "
#~ "`public_signup: false`; registration returns "
#~ "HTTP 403 without creating an account."
#~ " It does not fall back to an"
#~ " environment value that could reopen "
#~ "registration."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果运行时注册设置读取失败或超过一秒，网关会暂时关闭公开注册。有效的 `/site-config` "
#~ "响应仍返回 HTTP 200，保留站点身份和品牌，并返回 `public_signup: "
#~ "false`；注册返回 HTTP 403，不创建账号。系统不会回退到可能重新开放注册的环境变量值。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Because `/site-config` is unauthenticated "
#~ "and read while rendering every console"
#~ " page, the gateway does not repeat"
#~ " a failing read for every request."
#~ " Callers that arrive together while "
#~ "the setting's cache is cold share "
#~ "one store round-trip, and a failed"
#~ " read is reused for five seconds, "
#~ "so an outage costs one timeout per"
#~ " window rather than one per request."
#~ " Recovery needs no restart: the "
#~ "window expires on its own, and "
#~ "writing `signup_enabled` through the "
#~ "administrator API clears it at once."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "由于 `/site-config` "
#~ "无需鉴权，且每次渲染控制台页面都会读取它，网关不会为每个请求重复一次失败的读取。缓存尚未预热时并发到达的调用方共享同一次存储往返，失败的读取会复用五秒，因此一次故障只在每个窗口内产生一次超时，而不是每个请求各产生一次。恢复无需重启：该窗口会自行过期，通过管理员"
#~ " API 写入 `signup_enabled` 也会立即清除它。"

#~ msgid "Dark mode is the default, and that is deliberate"
#~ msgstr "默认是 dark 模式，这是有意为之"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` defaults to `dark`. "
#~ "In dark mode the manifest is "
#~ "loaded and validated, and the resolver"
#~ " logs what it *would* change, but "
#~ "current resolution stays effective:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 默认为 `dark`。dark "
#~ "模式下，manifest 会被加载并校验，解析器把它*本来会*改动的内容记进日志，但当前的解析结果仍然有效："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Setting only `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` therefore"
#~ " cannot change behaviour; you get a"
#~ " warning telling you the mode "
#~ "defaulted to `dark`. Config-path "
#~ "resolution treats an unrecognised mode "
#~ "as `dark` with a warning. Signup, "
#~ "`/site-config`, and the RAG feature "
#~ "policy are stricter: an explicitly empty"
#~ " or unknown mode, or `active` without"
#~ " a manifest path, closes signup (HTTP"
#~ " 403), makes `/site-config` report an"
#~ " unavailable configuration (HTTP 503), and"
#~ " makes authenticated `/v1/rag/status` and "
#~ "`/v1/rag/chat` requests return HTTP 503. "
#~ "Only an unset mode defaults to "
#~ "`dark`, including in Compose. Enable a"
#~ " manifest by running dark first, "
#~ "reading the comparison lines, and only"
#~ " then setting `active`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "因此，只设置 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 不会改变行为；系统会警告模式默认使用了 "
#~ "`dark`。配置路径解析会把无法识别的模式视为 `dark` 并记录警告。注册、`/site-"
#~ "config` 和 RAG 功能策略要求更严格：显式空值、未知模式，或选择 `active`"
#~ " 却未设置 manifest 路径时，会关闭注册（HTTP 403），让 "
#~ "`/site-config` 报告配置不可用（HTTP 503），并让已鉴权的 "
#~ "`/v1/rag/status` 和 `/v1/rag/chat` 请求返回 HTTP"
#~ " 503。只有未设置模式时才默认使用 `dark`，Compose 中也是如此。启用 "
#~ "manifest 时，应先运行 dark 模式、检查比较日志，再设置为 `active`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Mode warnings are logged once per "
#~ "distinct value per process. When "
#~ "diagnosing RAG configuration errors, check "
#~ "the startup logs and the backend's "
#~ "effective `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` and "
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`, rather than expecting"
#~ " the warning to repeat on every "
#~ "request. Correct the values and restart"
#~ " the backend. See [Docs RAG Assistant"
#~ "](rag-chat.md) for the feature restriction."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "每个进程对每个不同的模式值只记录一次警告。排查 RAG 配置错误时，请检查启动日志及后端实际使用的 "
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 和 "
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`，不要期待每次请求都重复警告。修正取值后重启后端。功能限制详见[文档 RAG"
#~ " 助手](rag-chat.md)。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Failure behaviour differs by mode, on"
#~ " purpose. In dark mode a manifest "
#~ "that will not load is logged and"
#~ " skipped. In active mode the manifest"
#~ " *is* where the paths come from, "
#~ "so a manifest that will not load"
#~ " — a lost overlay mount, a YAML"
#~ " error — refuses to start rather "
#~ "than quietly serving a different "
#~ "registry."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "失败行为按模式区分，这是刻意的。dark 模式下，加载不了的 manifest "
#~ "只被记录并跳过。active 模式下，路径*正是*从 manifest 来的，所以加载不了的 "
#~ "manifest——overlay 挂载丢了、YAML 写错了——会拒绝启动，而不是悄悄用另一份注册表对外服务。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The manifest root and `features` are "
#~ "closed schemas: unknown keys are "
#~ "rejected, including misspelled feature names"
#~ " or feature flags placed at the "
#~ "root. This changes the earlier behavior"
#~ " that silently ignored these keys. "
#~ "Before upgrading an active deployment, "
#~ "validate its actual overlay with the "
#~ "new backend code; the repository's "
#~ "example manifests do not validate "
#~ "privately maintained overlays. Correct "
#~ "misspellings and keep operator-specific "
#~ "metadata in a separate file. With "
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` set to the deployed"
#~ " manifest, run:"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "manifest 顶层与 `features` 使用封闭 "
#~ "schema：未知键会被拒绝，包括拼错的功能名称以及误放到顶层的功能开关。这改变了此前静默忽略这些键的行为。升级 active"
#~ " 部署前，请用新后端代码校验实际 overlay；仓库内的示例 manifest 不能替代对私有"
#~ " overlay 的校验。请修正拼写，并将运维人员自定义的元数据保存在独立文件中。将 "
#~ "`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 设为部署中的 manifest 路径后运行："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "This is not exhaustive typo detection:"
#~ " `paths`, `site`, `distribution`, and "
#~ "`deployment` still ignore unknown section "
#~ "keys for compatibility. In particular, "
#~ "check `paths.models` and the resolved "
#~ "model-registry log before activating an "
#~ "overlay; an unknown path key is "
#~ "treated as an omitted path and can"
#~ " select a legacy default. Strict "
#~ "validation of those sections is a "
#~ "separate compatibility change."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "这不是完整的拼写错误检测：为了兼容，`paths`、`site`、`distribution` 和 "
#~ "`deployment` 仍会忽略各节内的未知键。启用 overlay 前，尤其要检查 "
#~ "`paths.models` "
#~ "和解析后的模型注册表日志；未知的路径键会被当作未配置路径处理，从而可能选择旧默认值。收紧这些节的校验属于另一项兼容性变更。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "If an invalid active manifest reaches"
#~ " the HTTP handlers, signup remains "
#~ "closed and `/site-config` returns HTTP"
#~ " 503 without exposing file paths or"
#~ " parser errors. It cannot return a"
#~ " valid identity until the manifest is"
#~ " repaired."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "如果 HTTP 处理函数遇到无效的 active manifest，注册保持关闭"
#~ "，`/site-config` 返回 HTTP 503，不暴露文件路径或解析错误。在 "
#~ "manifest 修复前，接口无法返回有效的站点身份。"

#~ msgid ""
