#~ " `aria-invalid=\"true\"`。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Field layout.** The optional `fieldLayout`"
#~ " export receives the shared control, "
#~ "hint, error and action nodes, and "
#~ "the label's text and `htmlFor` id. "
#~ "It must render every supplied node, "
#~ "associate the label with that id, "
#~ "and preserve the `data-auth=\"field\"` "
#~ "and `data-auth=\"label\"` hooks. The "
#~ "control arrives already described, so "
#~ "the relationship survives any arrangement "
#~ "that renders every node. The neutral "
#~ "layout places the field action after "
#~ "the control and validation; a module "
#~ "may place it beside its label. "
#~ "`fieldLayout` is a supported export in"
#~ " its own right, not part of the"
#~ " deprecated class map."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**字段布局。** 可选的 `fieldLayout` "
#~ "导出接收共享控件、提示、错误与操作节点，以及标签文本和 `htmlFor` "
#~ "id。它必须渲染所有传入节点，将标签关联到该 id，并保留 `data-auth=\"field\"`"
#~ " 和 `data-auth=\"label\"` "
#~ "属性。控件传入时已经带有描述关联，因此只要每个节点都被渲染，无论如何排列，这种关联都会保留。默认布局将字段操作放在控件与验证信息之后；模块可以将其放在标签旁边。`fieldLayout`"
#~ " 本身就是受支持的独立导出，不属于已弃用的类名映射。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**Deprecated `authAppearance` class map.** The"
#~ " class-map export remains a supported"
#~ " compatibility surface throughout API v1;"
#~ " it holds class names only. New "
#~ "styling should prefer scoped `data-auth`"
#~ " and state selectors; class names are"
#~ " module-owned details. The semantic-"
#~ "style migration is not complete. "
#~ "Removing this adapter requires the next"
#~ " API revision, a documented migration "
#~ "and comparison of normal, invalid, "
#~ "loading and keyboard states. Deprecation "
#~ "does not allow breaking existing v1 "
#~ "modules."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**已弃用的 `authAppearance` 类名映射。** 此类名映射导出在整个 API"
#~ " v1 生命周期内仍是受支持的兼容接口，只包含类名。新样式应优先使用限定作用域的 `data-"
#~ "auth` 和状态选择器；类名是模块自己的实现细节。语义样式迁移尚未完成。移除此适配层必须发布下一版 "
#~ "API、提供迁移文档，并对比正常、无效、加载和键盘操作状态。弃用并不意味着可以破坏现有 v1 模块。"

