#~ msgid "4. Backend extensions"
#~ msgstr "4\\. 后端扩展"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` is an optional comma-"
#~ "delimited list of trusted, local Python"
#~ " module names. It is empty by "
#~ "default. Each module must expose a "
#~ "synchronous `register()` function that takes"
#~ " no arguments. The gateway imports "
#~ "and registers each module once per "
#~ "process, after loading dotenv and before"
#~ " constructing runtime routes or consuming"
#~ " their registries. An import or "
#~ "registration failure aborts startup; the "
#~ "gateway does not silently use a "
#~ "different adapter."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 是可选的、以逗号分隔的受信任本地 Python "
#~ "模块名列表，默认值为空。每个模块必须提供同步、无参数的 `register()` 函数。网关加载 "
#~ "dotenv "
#~ "后、构造运行时路由或使用相关注册表前，在每个进程中导入并注册每个模块一次。导入或注册失败会中止启动；网关不会悄悄换用其他适配器。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Extensions register factories through "
#~ "`serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, "
#~ "factory, *, override=False)`. A factory "
#~ "receives a configuration dictionary and "
#~ "returns an adapter, before built-in "
#~ "provider defaults are applied. Registering "
#~ "an existing extension kind is an "
#~ "error. Replacing a built-in kind "
#~ "requires `override=True` and emits a log"
#~ " entry. Registered kinds also become "
#~ "reserved provider labels. The startup "
#~ "`register()` function may populate the "
#~ "existing runtime-setting and provider "
#~ "metadata dictionaries before their consumers"
#~ " run; it must mutate those shared "
#~ "dictionaries rather than replace them."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "扩展通过 `serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind,"
#~ " factory, *, override=False)` 注册工厂。工厂在内置 "
#~ "provider 默认值应用前接收配置字典并返回适配器。注册已存在的扩展 kind 会报错。替换内置"
#~ " kind 必须设置 `override=True`，且会记录日志。注册的 kind "
#~ "也会成为保留的 provider 标签。启动时的 `register()` "
#~ "函数可在使用方运行前，填充现有的运行时设置和 provider 元数据字典；必须修改这些共享字典，而不能替换它们。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The deployment must make these modules"
#~ " importable, for example through its "
#~ "read-only overlay mount. This executes "
#~ "trusted server code, not user-supplied"
#~ " configuration: do not derive module "
#~ "names from requests or allow an "
#~ "admin form to choose them. The "
#~ "loader does not fetch remote modules "
#~ "or load code per request. Import "
#~ "all extension code during startup, avoid"
#~ " later lazy imports or live code "
#~ "reloads, and restart the backend when"
#~ " changing the mounted extension. See "
#~ "[Deployment-local adapters](adding-models.md"
#~ "#deployment-local-adapters) for a minimal"
#~ " factory example."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "部署必须确保这些模块可导入，例如通过只读 overlay "
#~ "挂载提供模块。这里执行的是受信任的服务端代码，不是用户提交的配置：不要从请求推导模块名，也不要允许管理表单选择模块。加载器不会获取远程模块，也不会逐请求加载代码。请在启动阶段导入全部扩展代码，避免之后的延迟导入或代码热重载，并在修改挂载的扩展后重启后端。最小工厂示例见[部署本地适配器"
#~ "](adding-models.md#deployment-local-adapters)。"

#~ msgid "Cloud Agent access"
#~ msgstr "云端 Agent 访问权限"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The gateway keeps its fixed role "
#~ "hierarchy and resolves current account "
#~ "state. The deployment owns the rule "
#~ "for who can use or administer its"
#~ " Cloud Agent. A trusted extension "
#~ "registers one synchronous callback during "
#~ "`register()` with "
#~ "`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)`. The"
#~ " callback receives a read-only "
#~ "mapping containing exactly `user_id` and "
#~ "`role`, after the gateway has verified"
#~ " that the user exists and has "
#~ "status `active`. It receives no profile,"
#~ " credentials, or database connection."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "网关保留固定的角色层级，并解析账户当前状态。由部署定义谁可以使用或管理其云端 Agent。受信任的扩展在 "
#~ "`register()` 中通过 "
#~ "`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)` "
#~ "注册一个同步回调。网关先确认用户存在且状态为 `active`，再向回调传入仅包含 `user_id` "
#~ "和 `role` 的只读映射。回调不会收到用户资料、凭据或数据库连接。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The callback returns a `list[str]` or"
#~ " `tuple[str, ...]` of explicit permissions:"
#~ " `agent.use` permits Agent use, and "
#~ "`agent.admin` permits Agent administration. "
#~ "Administration requires both permissions. "
#~ "Unknown, repeated, or non-string "
#~ "permissions are invalid; values are not"
#~ " coerced. Registering a second policy "
#~ "is an error. With no registered "
#~ "policy, Agent access is denied for "
#~ "every role. The gateway imposes no "
#~ "deployment-specific role-to-permission "
#~ "rule."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "回调以 `list[str]` 或 `tuple[str, ...]` "
#~ "返回显式权限：`agent.use` 允许使用 Agent，`agent.admin` 允许管理 "
#~ "Agent。管理操作需要同时具备这两项权限。未知、重复或非字符串权限均无效，框架不会强制转换取值。注册第二个策略会报错。没有注册策略时，所有角色都无权访问"
#~ " Agent。网关不规定特定部署的角色与权限映射规则。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The standalone Agent reads `GET "
#~ "/internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access` using the"
#~ " existing `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer "
#~ "token. A successful response contains "
#~ "exactly `user_id`, `allowed`, and "
#~ "`permissions`; `allowed` is true exactly "
#~ "when `agent.use` is present. Permissions "
#~ "are returned in the order `agent.use`,"
#~ " `agent.admin`. An intentional denial is"
#~ " HTTP 200 with `allowed: false` and"
#~ " `permissions: []`. The endpoint reads "
#~ "the gateway's operational store and "
#~ "evaluates the policy on each request;"
#~ " it does not cache permission "
#~ "decisions. Account reads retain the "
#~ "existing user-cache semantics: "
#~ "`CachedOperationalStore` caches user rows for"
#~ " 60 seconds, and account changes "
#~ "through that wrapper invalidate the "
#~ "affected entry. Direct database edits or"
#~ " writes in another process may remain"
#~ " unseen until that cache entry "
#~ "expires."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "独立 Agent 使用现有的 `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` "
#~ "bearer token 调用 `GET /internal/users/{user_id"
#~ "}/agent-access`。成功响应仅包含 `user_id`、`allowed` 和 "
#~ "`permissions`；只有包含 `agent.use` 时，`allowed` 才为 "
#~ "true。权限按 `agent.use`、`agent.admin` 的顺序返回。策略明确拒绝访问时返回 "
#~ "HTTP 200，内容为 `allowed: false` 和 "
#~ "`permissions: []`。端点在每次请求时读取网关的 operational store"
#~ " 并评估策略，不缓存权限判定结果。账户读取保留现有的用户缓存语义：`CachedOperationalStore` "
#~ "将用户行缓存 60 "
#~ "秒，通过该包装层修改账户会使对应缓存项失效。直接修改数据库或由其他进程写入的变更，可能要等到缓存项过期后才会被读取到。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Unknown or inactive accounts receive "
#~ "HTTP 403 with error type "
#~ "`subject_unavailable`, before the callback "
#~ "runs. A callback exception or invalid"
#~ " result receives HTTP 503 with error"
#~ " type `agent_access_unavailable`, without policy"
#~ " details. Both use the gateway's "
#~ "standard `{\"error\": {\"type\": ..., "
#~ "\"message\": ...}}` envelope. Dispatch "
#~ "authentication and unavailable internal API"
#~ " configuration retain their existing 401"
#~ " and 404 responses. The legacy "
#~ "user-status and model-catalog endpoints "
#~ "retain their existing contracts."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "账户不存在或未处于 active 状态时，在调用回调前返回 HTTP 403，错误类型为"
#~ " `subject_unavailable`。回调抛出异常或返回无效结果时，返回 HTTP 503，错误类型为"
#~ " `agent_access_unavailable`，不包含策略细节。两者都使用网关标准的 `{\"error\":"
#~ " {\"type\": ..., \"message\": ...}}` "
#~ "响应结构。Dispatch 鉴权失败和内部 API 未配置时，仍分别返回现有的 401"
#~ " 和 404 响应。旧 user-status 和 "
#~ "model-catalog 端点保留原有契约。"

#~ msgid "Quota reporting"
#~ msgstr "配额报告"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The gateway keeps quota reporting and"
#~ " quota-aware routing independent of "
#~ "the service that measures usage. The "
#~ "public framework supplies the Providers "
#~ "tab's result rows, disabled-key cards,"
#~ " key discovery and `gather_all`, plus "
#~ "RouteWise's quota snapshots. No quota "
#~ "source is enabled by default. A "
#~ "trusted backend extension connects an "
#~ "authorized usage API or the operator's"
#~ " own metering service; the framework "
#~ "does not require a particular supplier,"
#~ " website login or cookie."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "网关将配额报告和配额感知路由与用量计量服务解耦。公共框架提供 Providers "
#~ "标签页的结果行、禁用密钥卡片、密钥发现和 `gather_all`，以及 RouteWise "
#~ "的配额快照。默认不启用任何配额来源。受信任的后端扩展负责接入已授权的用量 API "
#~ "或运营者自己的计量服务；框架不要求特定供应商、网页登录或 cookie。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "An extension's `register()` calls "
#~ "`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
#~ "display_name, fetch)`; `fetch` is awaited "
#~ "as `fetch(operational_store, services)` and "
#~ "returns one `ProviderQuotaResult` per "
#~ "configured key, converting its own "
#~ "failures into results rather than "
#~ "raising. The admin endpoint supplies the"
#~ " store and services; RouteWise currently"
#~ " calls it with `(None, None)`, so "
#~ "the fetcher must also work without "
#~ "those objects. Registration runs at "
#~ "startup, not when the module is "
#~ "merely imported. A fetcher queries "
#~ "usage; it does not send user "
#~ "inference requests or change the route's"
#~ " inference protocol."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "扩展的 `register()` 调用 "
#~ "`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
#~ "display_name, fetch)`；框架通过 `fetch(operational_store, "
#~ "services)` 等待 `fetch` 完成，每个已配置密钥返回一个 "
#~ "`ProviderQuotaResult`，并将失败转换成结果而不是抛出异常。管理端点会提供存储和服务对象；RouteWise "
#~ "目前传入 `(None, "
#~ "None)`，因此抓取器也必须能在没有这些对象的情况下工作。注册发生在启动阶段，而不是仅导入模块时。抓取器查询用量，不负责发送用户推理请求，也不改变路由的推理协议。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Each result contains `ProviderQuotaUsage` rows"
#~ " with `label`, `used`, `limit`, `unit` "
#~ "and an optional timezone-aware "
#~ "`reset_at`. The deployment's provider "
#~ "identifier links the source to its "
#~ "routes; it is not a hard-coded "
#~ "vendor enum. `quota_source.provider`, `usage_label`"
#~ " and `unit` must exactly match a "
#~ "returned result and usage row. Report"
#~ " the account/window shared by that "
#~ "quota pool, and keep independent "
#~ "accounts in distinct sources. Do not "
#~ "sum unrelated keys or present a "
#~ "failed query as zero usage."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "每个结果包含若干 `ProviderQuotaUsage` 行，字段包括 "
#~ "`label`、`used`、`limit`、`unit` 和可选的带时区 `reset_at`。部署定义的 "
#~ "provider "
#~ "标识将来源关联到路由，并不是写死的供应商枚举。`quota_source.provider`、`usage_label` 和"
#~ " `unit` "
#~ "必须与返回的结果及用量行精确匹配。报告该配额池共享账户及窗口的用量，独立账户应使用不同的来源。不要把不相关密钥的用量相加，也不要把查询失败表示成零用量。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The UI can display percentages, "
#~ "currencies and other units, but "
#~ "RouteWise's quota admission consumes one "
#~ "**request** at a time and requires "
#~ "a compatible count-based source. A "
#~ "percentage alone is not a request "
#~ "allowance. The source owns window "
#~ "boundaries and reset times; `quota.limit` "
#~ "is a cross-check against its "
#~ "reported limit, not a replacement "
#~ "measurement. A source with no successful"
#~ " snapshot stays unready. A failed "
#~ "refresh does not manufacture a fresh "
#~ "balance; an existing pool retains its"
#~ " last successful snapshot and local "
#~ "increments."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "UI 可以显示百分比、货币和其他单位，但 RouteWise "
#~ "的配额准入每次消耗一次**请求**，要求兼容的计数型来源。只有百分比不足以表示可用请求数。来源负责窗口边界和重置时间；`quota.limit`"
#~ " "
#~ "用于核对来源报告的上限，不能替代实际测量。没有成功快照的来源保持未就绪状态。刷新失败不会凭空产生新的余额；已有的池保留上一次成功快照及本地增量。"

#~ msgid "Run a local quota source"
#~ msgstr "运行本地配额来源"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The complete [example "
#~ "extension](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py) reads"
#~ " `/usage` from the bundled fake "
#~ "provider. Its in-memory daily counter"
#~ " is only a teaching fixture, resets"
#~ " on process restart or at UTC "
#~ "midnight, and is not production "
#~ "accounting. It uses no real account "
#~ "or credential and is loaded only "
#~ "when explicitly selected through "
#~ "`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "完整的[示例扩展](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py)读取随仓库提供的模拟供应商的"
#~ " `/usage`。它的内存每日计数器仅用于教学，在进程重启或 UTC "
#~ "午夜时重置，不能用于生产计费。它不使用真实账户或凭据，只有通过 `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` "
#~ "显式选择后才会加载。"

