#~ "Send several requests to calibrate the"
#~ " cost envelope and allow the first"
#~ " five-second probe/snapshot cycle to "
#~ "finish:"
#~ msgstr "发送几次请求以校准成本包络，并等待首个五秒探测及快照刷新周期完成："

#~ msgid ""
#~ "The response identifies the selected "
#~ "fixture. Initial requests use the "
#~ "fallback until the quota route has "
#~ "both a usage snapshot and cost-"
#~ "envelope evidence. Accepted chat requests, "
#~ "including active probes, consume the "
#~ "mock quota; health, model discovery and"
#~ " `/usage` reads do not. To simulate"
#~ " exhaustion, restart only the quota "
#~ "fixture with `--quota-limit 100 "
#~ "--quota-used 100`; after the next "
#~ "snapshot refresh, requests continue through"
#~ " the fallback. Stop each local "
#~ "process with Ctrl+C when finished."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "响应会标识选中的模拟服务。初始请求走备用路由，直到配额路由同时具备用量快照和成本包络依据。已接受的聊天请求（包括主动探测）会消耗模拟配额；健康检查、模型发现和"
#~ " `/usage` 查询不会。要模拟额度耗尽，只需使用 `--quota-limit "
#~ "100 --quota-used 100` "
#~ "重启配额模拟服务；下一次快照刷新后，请求继续由备用路由服务。完成后使用 Ctrl+C 停止各个本地进程。"

